---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: 채용정보
eyebrow: Etc
lead: (주)트라이얼정보통신의 채용 절차와 인사·복리후생 제도를 안내합니다.
description: (주)트라이얼정보통신 채용 정보 안내입니다.
---
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <picture>
      <source media="(max-width: 47.99rem)" srcset="{{ '/images/photo/etc/m_recruit.png' | url }}">
      <img src="{{ '/images/photo/etc/recruit.png' | url }}" alt="트라이얼정보통신 채용 안내"
           style="display:block; width:100%; height:auto; margin:0 auto var(--space-8)">
    </picture>

    <div class="grid grid--2">
      {% set sections = [
        { title: "전형방법", items: career.recruitment.process },
        { title: "제출서류", items: career.recruitment.documents },
        { title: "접수방법", items: career.recruitment.application },
        { title: "근무시간", items: career.recruitment.hours },
        { title: "인사제도", items: career.recruitment.personnel },
        { title: "복리후생제도", items: career.recruitment.benefits }
      ] %}
      {%- for section in sections %}
      <article class="section-card reveal">
        <p class="section-card__label">{{ section.title }}</p>
        <ul class="product-card__features">
          {%- for item in section.items %}<li>{{ item }}</li>{% endfor %}
        </ul>
      </article>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
